<title>USA: Airgas CFO resigns for personal reasons.</title>
<headline>Airgas CFO resigns for personal reasons.</headline>
<dateline>RADNOR, Pa. 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Airgas Inc said Thursday Britton H. Murdoch, chief financial officer, has decided to resign for personal reasons related to a prolonged illness in his family.</p>
<p>Murdoch joined Airgas in 1987 as head of corporate development and moved into his current position in 1990. He will continue with the company through a transition period.</p>
<p>A search for his successor will begin immediately, Airgas said.  -- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
